With the exception of the peculiar first pendant, all pendant values are 0, 1, 2, or 3.",,,,S,,60.5,38,19,0.0,0.0,36,0.0,0,,,29.5,0.0,0.7631578947368421,0.18421052631578946,0.05263157894736842,0.0,1,1.5263157894736843
