1000214,UR1051,KH0062,Hacienda Ullujalla y Callengo,,"""Museo Nacional, Lima, Peru""","1. Pendant 15 was broken and knotted together at 11.0 cm.
2. The Museum records the provence as Hacienda Ullujalla y Callengo (about 40 km from Ica).  All of the quipus AS052-AS056 have the same attribution.
